 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A set of parallel, uniformly spaced slicing planes; a bounding box (sub-volume) defined by axis-aligned edges; viewing direction; texture coordinate mapping parameters.
-*   **Output:** Updated intersection positions and texture coordinates for the current slicing plane, stored in the `ActiveIntersectionList`.
