 **Parameters:**
 *   **deltaPos:** The constant difference in intersection position on the same edge between adjacent slicing planes. It depends only on the viewing direction and is invariant for all sub-volumes [S1].
-*   **deltaTexCoords:** The constant difference in texture coordinates between adjacent slicing planes. If sub-volumes are packed into a large 3D texture, this is constant for all sub-volumes; otherwise, it may depend on the texture size if scaled to [0, 1] [S1].
