-1.  **Initialization (First Plane):** For the first slicing plane, compute intersections and texture coordinates for each edge of the box using the traditional method. Insert all valid intersections into the `ActiveIntersectionList` and sort them [S1].
-2.  **Delta Calculation:** Compute `deltaPos` and `deltaTexCoords` based on the viewing direction and texture mapping. Due to the axis-aligned nature of the box, these vectors have only one non-zero element [S1].
